<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'none'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; connect-src 'none'; img-src 'none'; font-src 'none'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; frame-src 'none'; worker-src 'none'">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>S088 · Permission failure rehearsal</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
  <script src="model.js" defer></script>
  <script src="app.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>
  <a class="skip" href="#controls">Skip to rehearsal controls</a>
  <main>
    <p id="training-banner" class="banner">Training rehearsal - synthetic data - not a live Azure result</p>
    <h1>S088 · Permission failure</h1>
    <p>Deny an operation; identify an invalid success-shaped error response.</p>
    <p>Source <strong>S088</strong> · Parent <strong>D-S088</strong> · Card <strong>A-S088</strong> · Packet <strong>SC-S088</strong> · Frozen Kano <strong>S</strong></p>

    <section aria-labelledby="preconditions">
      <h2 id="preconditions">Fixed teaching envelope</h2>
      <p>The fictional action is <strong>promote-candidate</strong> in <strong>rehearsal-088</strong>. These operation, lease, permission and error labels are teaching data, not executable platform commands or identity controls.</p>
      <p>Each independent attempt starts from old-v1 at 100%, candidate-v2 at 0%, and required state revision 7 with <code>saved-draft-088</code>. No real traffic, resources, permissions, authentication, credentials, clocks, or network calls are used.</p>
      <p>Compare the explicit denied response with the deliberately invalid 200 / <code>ok: true</code> error. A verifier pass for an honest denial means safe abort, <strong>not</strong> completed migration. Missing evidence stays unknown.</p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="controls">
      <h2 id="controls">Conduct a bounded rehearsal</h2>
      <form id="lesson-form" aria-describedby="control-help limit-note" novalidate>
        <label for="decision">Permission decision fixture</label>
        <select id="decision" name="decision">
          <option value="denied">Denied — scoped PermissionDenied</option>
          <option value="allowed">Allowed — observed completion</option>
          <option value="unknown">Unknown — decision and observation missing</option>
        </select>
        <label for="response">Response fixture</label>
        <select id="response" name="response">
          <option value="explicit">Explicit result</option>
          <option value="success-shaped">Invalid success-shaped error (denial only)</option>
        </select>
        <p id="control-help">Only a denied decision supports the invalid response comparison. Changing the decision restores Explicit result. Selects use arrow keys; Enter or Space activates buttons.</p>
        <div class="buttons">
          <button id="run-lesson" type="submit">Rehearse promotion</button>
          <button id="reset-lesson" type="button">Reset rehearsal</button>
        </div>
      </form>
      <p id="limit-note">At most six independent attempts; earlier failures and unknowns remain until explicit reset.</p>
      <p id="input-error" role="alert" hidden></p>
      <noscript><p>This synthetic exercise requires JavaScript. No result has been observed.</p></noscript>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="result-heading" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">
      <h2 id="result-heading">Latest result</h2>
      <p>Operation outcome: <strong id="operation-outcome" data-outcome="not-run">Not run</strong></p>
      <p id="operation-detail">No operation outcome has been observed.</p>
      <p>Verifier: <strong id="verifier" data-verdict="not-run">Not run</strong></p>
      <p id="verifier-reason">No migration or preserved-state observation is claimed before a rehearsal.</p>
      <p id="observation-label">Baseline fixture only — not a new observation.</p>
      <dl class="state-grid">
        <div><dt>Old-v1 route</dt><dd id="old-route">100%</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Candidate-v2 route</dt><dd id="candidate-route">0%</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Required state</dt><dd id="required-state">revision 7 · saved-draft-088</dd></div>
      </dl>
      <h3>Synthetic response, not an HTTP request</h3>
      <pre id="response-trace">No response fixture has been produced.</pre>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="ledger-heading">
      <h2 id="ledger-heading">Retained outcome ledger</h2>
      <p>Counters classify <strong>operation outcomes</strong>, not verifier passes or live user migrations. Every attempted fixture remains in the denominator.</p>
      <dl class="state-grid">
        <div><dt>Attempted</dt><dd id="attempt-count">0</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Success</dt><dd id="success-count">0</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Failure</dt><dd id="failure-count">0</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Unknown</dt><dd id="unknown-count">0</dd></div>
      </dl>
      <div class="table-wrap" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Retained synthetic attempt history">
        <table>
          <caption>Independent fixed-snapshot attempts; retained until reset</caption>
          <thead><tr><th scope="col">Attempt</th><th scope="col">Decision</th><th scope="col">Response fixture</th><th scope="col">Operation</th><th scope="col">Synthetic status</th><th scope="col">Verifier</th><th scope="col">Routing / observation</th><th scope="col">Required state</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody id="history"></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p id="history-empty">No attempts recorded.</p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="limits">
      <h2 id="limits">Acceptance and limits</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Explicit denial: failed operation, synthetic 403 PermissionDenied, unchanged observed routing and state; verifier pass for safe abort only.</li>
        <li>Success-shaped denial: failed operation despite 200 / ok true / succeeded; verifier fail for the invalid success fallback.</li>
        <li>Allowed fixture: synthetic success only with matching observed candidate routing and preserved required state.</li>
        <li>Missing decision or observation: unknown, not success; baseline is last known only.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>History is memory-only and is cleared by Reset or page reload. This does not model durable orchestration, real authorization, real HTTP transport, production Node.js 24, native Azure behavior, source-parent completion, or five-nines reliability. IaC: N/A. No deployment or spending is authorized.</p>
      <p><a href="README.md">Lesson instructions and evidence</a> · <a href="manifest.json">Versioned lesson manifest</a></p>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
